@base = http://127.0.0.1:8082

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Search
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=electronics&size=2&page=0
### Repeat search
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=electronics&size=2&page=0
### Update fixture row
PUT {{base}}/api/products/103
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Wireless Mouse","category":"accessories","priceCents":3000,"stock":0}
### Search after update
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=electronics&size=2&page=0
### Documented invalid input
GET {{base}}/api/products?size=0
### Missing row
PUT {{base}}/api/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Mouse","category":"electronics","priceCents":2500,"stock":2}
